{"comment_text": {"ja72:0.1": "", "ja72:0.2": "", "ja72:0.3": "", "ja72:0.4": "", "ja72:1.1": "A magnificent white elephant rescues a lost man and returns him home on his back. But, falling prey to greed, the man asks for ivory from the elephant’s tusks. The noble creature freely offered his tusks to the ungrateful wretch. ", "ja72:1.2": "", "ja72:1.3": "", "ja72:1.4": "", "ja72:2.1": ""}, "html_text": {"ja72:0.1": "<article id='ja72'><header><ul><li class='division'>{}</li>", "ja72:0.2": "<li>{}</li>", "ja72:0.3": "<li>{}</li></ul>", "ja72:0.4": "<h1 class='sutta-title'>{}</h1></header>", "ja72:1.1": "<blockquote class='gatha'><p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja72:1.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja72:1.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja72:1.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p></blockquote>", "ja72:2.1": "<p class='endsutta'>{}</p></article>"}, "root_text": {"ja72:0.1": "Jātaka ", "ja72:0.2": "Ekakanipāta ", "ja72:0.3": "Varuṇavagga ", "ja72:0.4": "2. Sīlavahatthijātaka ", "ja72:1.1": "“Akataññussa posassa, ", "ja72:1.2": "niccaṁ vivaradassino; ", "ja72:1.3": "Sabbañce pathaviṁ dajjā, ", "ja72:1.4": "neva naṁ abhirādhaye”ti. ", "ja72:2.1": "Sīlavahatthijātakaṁ dutiyaṁ. "}, "translation_text": {"ja72:0.1": "Stories of Past Lives 72 ", "ja72:0.2": "The Book of the Ones ", "ja72:0.3": "The Warding Tree ", "ja72:0.4": "The Virtuous Elephant: a past life story ", "ja72:1.1": "An ungrateful person, ", "ja72:1.2": "always looking for opportunity, ", "ja72:1.3": "even if given the whole earth, ", "ja72:1.4": "would still not be satisfied. ", "ja72:2.1": ""}, "variant_text": {"ja72:0.1": "", "ja72:0.2": "", "ja72:0.3": "", "ja72:0.4": "", "ja72:1.1": "", "ja72:1.2": "", "ja72:1.3": "pathaviṁ → paṭhaviṁ (bj, sya1ed, sya2ed, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja72:1.4": "", "ja72:2.1": "Sīlavahatthijātakaṁ → sīlavanāgarājajātakaṁ (bj); sīlavanāgajātakaṁ (sya1ed, sya2ed, pts-vp-pli1) "}, "reference_text": {"ja72:0.1": "", "ja72:0.2": "", "ja72:0.3": "", "ja72:0.4": "", "ja72:1.1": "ms22J_159, msdiv72, ndp22.18, pts-vp-pli1.322, vri68.17", "ja72:1.2": "", "ja72:1.3": "", "ja72:1.4": "", "ja72:2.1": "ms22J_160"}, "keys_order": ["ja72:0.1", "ja72:0.2", "ja72:0.3", "ja72:0.4", "ja72:1.1", "ja72:1.2", "ja72:1.3", "ja72:1.4", "ja72:2.1"]}